 "title": "Unidirectional ESD protection diodes, 2.5 V to 12 V stand-off, SOD-523",
 "source": {
  "document": "ESD5Z2.5T1/D",
  "revision": "Rev. 16, February 2024",
  "pages": 6
 },
 "summary": "The ESD5Z family is a set of single-line, unidirectional transient voltage suppressors in the 1.2 mm by 0.8 mm SOD-523 package. Six stand-off voltages from 2.5 V to 12 V are offered, with peak pulse power up to 240 W for an 8/20 µs surge IEC 61000-4-2 level 4 protection and ±30 kV contact and air ESD ratings. Leakage is in the tens of nanoamps for the 3.3 V and higher parts, and response is typically under 1 ns. SZ-prefixed versions are AEC-Q101 qualified and PPAP capable for automotive use.",
 "key_figures": [
  [
   "Working peak reverse voltage VRWM",
   "5.0 V max (ESD5Z5.0); family 2.5 V to 12 V"
